	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0502_businessman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたらしい　オフィスには
ポケモンが　いてほしいな……▼
だけど　かのじょの　まえで
そんなこと　いえるわけないよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:33:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T06:41:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>新しい　オフィスには
ポケモンが　いてほしいな……▼
だけど　彼女の　前で
そんなこと　いえるわけないよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:33:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T06:41:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア前
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:28:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BUSINESSMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T08:45:58" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T01:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
