			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0502_policeman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ゆくえふめいの　ポケモン……▼
もし　はんにんが
プラズマだん　だとしても▽
どこにいるのか　わからんのだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:32:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T08:42:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>行方不明の　ポケモン……▼
もし　犯人が
プラズマ団　だとしても▽
どこにいるのか　わからんのだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:34:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T08:42:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア前
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:28:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>POLICEMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:29:59" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T01:39:32" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0502_policeman_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>にがそうとした　ポケモンが
トレーナーの　もとに　もどる……▼
きいたことは　あるが
じっさいに　みると　むねをうたれるね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:35:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:18:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>逃がそうとした　ポケモンが
トレーナーの　もとに　戻る……▼
きいたことは　あるが
実際に　みると　胸を打たれるね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:35:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:18:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア後
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:28:21" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>POLICEMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:30:01" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T01:39:32" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0502_ol_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしの　ポケモン……
どこに　きえたのかしら……？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:17:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T06:41:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしの　ポケモン……
どこに　消えたのかしら……？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T09:17:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T06:41:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・クリア前
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T08:42:31" />
		</CommentCell>
